# Publishing them would redistribute the game.
backup/

# --- Decompilation artifacts ---
# Full class/method dumps derived from the game's proprietary code.
# The findings that matter are summarised in NOTES.md instead.
recon/

# --- Redistributed third-party loader + build output ---
tools/bepinex-staging/
tools/*.zip
dist/

# --- .NET build output ---
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.user

# --- Decompilation output and the decompiler itself ---
# Cpp2IL's dump is the game's compiled code in readable form. Publishing it would
